The bundle-explorer `describe` attestation: the object-level description of a
deterministic term, which BOTH the native core-bundle projection and the browser's
`query_local` route must reproduce byte-for-byte (`crates/mcp/tests/witness_explore.rs`).

GMEOW-produced output, so it carries this repository's licence. Do not hand-edit; it is
re-derived only under `GMEOW_WITNESS_BLESS=1`.
